Date: Mon, 27 Jan 2025 16:35:14 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 520/913] plat-stm32mp2: scmi: add mailbox support for cortexm

scmi_server_scpfw can now support a second SCMI client that communicate
with OP-TEE by shared memory and a mailbox. Parameters come from the DT.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [ST downstream https://github.com/STMicroelectronics/optee_os.git 4ee243b9e6b8b8743a2c6abd4a838d075f804e64 plat-stm32mp2: scmi: add mailbox support for cortexm]
Signed-off-by: Valentin Caron <valentin.caron@foss.st.com>
Change-Id: I0961573979f0128f5cc7cfff30266cd6e1b78458
---
